# Angelic Destiny: "When enchanted creature dies, return this card to its owner's hand." Bot1's Bears wear it from turn 3; on turn 5
# Bot1 destroys them with its own Terror, the Aura follows them to the graveyard (CR 704.5m) and the trigger goes on the stack. In
# response Bot2 exiles the Aura from Bot1's graveyard with Cling to Dust: it is a new object (CR 400.7), so the trigger returns nothing
# (the 2011-09-22 ruling) and the Destiny stays in exile, not in Bot1's hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Grizzly Bears
Angelic Destiny
Terror
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Cling to Dust
Plains x20

